# hair/adult/tousled: Tousled (A3's hero): locks over the brow, the cowlick
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (polish i1, gen_cap.py) capped R / L: no strands hanging over the cheek in front of the ear (the archer's face)
use person
body adult
role hair tousled
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hairpose

